{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，<strong>美國主要零售商在售的RTX 5080的實際成交價已全面衝破2000美元(約合人民幣13322元)關口。</strong>RTX 5080最低可購價格從兩個月前的約1200美元(約合人民幣7994元)一路推高至1979.99美元(約合人民幣13190元)，漲幅高達800美元(約合人民幣5329元)。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584330.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.196182+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:13:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.544138+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:18:24.544138+00:00","content_hash":"f9539255dcb5ba592dc6df4d79d3b93efa9d11d35760c4ea05a765c90978dbb5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}